Association StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation
    documentation "This association represents student information as reported in the context of the student's relationship to the education organization. Enrollment relationship semantics are covered by StudentSchoolAssociation."
    domain entity Student
        documentation "A reference to the student."
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization representing the context of the student information."
    shared string ProfileThumbnail
        documentation "Locator reference for the student photo. The specification for that reference is left to local definition."
        is optional
    common CohortYear
        documentation "The type and year of a cohort (e.g., 9th grade) the student belongs to as determined by the year that student entered a specific grade."
        is optional collection
    common StudentIndicator
        documentation "An indicator or metric computed for the student (e.g., at risk)."
        is optional collection
    shared string IdentificationCode named LoginId
        documentation "The login ID for the user; used for security access control interface."
        is optional
    descriptor PrimaryLearningDeviceAwayFromSchool
        documentation "The type of device the student uses most often to complete learning activities away from school."
        is optional
    descriptor PrimaryLearningDeviceAccess
        documentation "An indication of whether the primary learning device is shared or not shared with another individual."
        is optional
    descriptor PrimaryLearningDeviceProvider
        documentation "The provider of the primary learning device."
        is optional
    bool InternetAccessInResidence
        documentation "An indication of whether the student is able to access the internet in their primary place of residence."
        is optional
    descriptor BarrierToInternetAccessInResidence
        documentation "An indication of the barrier to having internet access in the student’s primary place of residence."
        is optional
    descriptor InternetAccessTypeInResidence
        documentation "The primary type of internet service used in the student’s primary place of residence."
        is optional
    descriptor InternetPerformanceInResidence
        documentation "An indication of whether the student can complete the full range of learning activities, including video streaming and assignment upload, without interruptions caused by poor internet performance in their primary place of residence."
        is optional
    common DisplacedStudent
        documentation "Information about student who was enrolled, or eligible for enrollment, but has temporarily or permanently enrolled in another school or district because of a crisis-related disruption in educational services."
        is optional collection